      "name": "test jkl",
      "title": "Add a guided first-time user experience",
      "category": "User Experience",
      "problem": "New users may not immediately understand where to start or what actions are available when they first open the application. This can make the initial experience confusing and increase the learning curve.",
      "solution": "Introduce a short interactive walkthrough when a user accesses the application for the first time. The walkthrough would highlight the main features, explain important buttons and navigation options, and provide a quick introduction should be able to understand the application more quickly, navigate confidently to the application's core functionality.",
      "benefit": "Users should be able to understand the application more quickly, navigate confidently, and start using its main features without needing external instructions.",
